BT /F2 12 Tf 58 693 Td (1. Project overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 58 671 Td (This project is a small web application for students to take a timed quiz about Python. A student) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 58 658 Td (can create an account or sign in, answer five multiple-choice questions, submit the quiz, and view) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 58 645 Td (a score and feedback message.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 58 632 Td (The application is built with Django, a Python web framework. Django handles URLs, user accounts,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 58 619 Td (sessions, database access, form processing, and HTML templates. The browser displays the pages,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 58 606 Td (applies CSS styling, and runs JavaScript for the countdown display.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 58 593 Td (The project is designed as a learning/demo app. Quiz questions are currently stored in the Python) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 58 580 Td (code, and scores are saved in a local SQLite database.) Tj ET
